nodes.body:
@BBuf Could you review this follow-up to #39889, which you reviewed and merged?

That change records each round's server-reported prompt length. This PR uses those lengths in `calculate_metrics` when the multi-turn caller passes `input_requests=None`, fixing zero headline input tokens and input throughput while preserving the single-turn accounting. The focused and adjacent benchmark tests pass (19 tests), and the PR lint check is green.

I cannot add a formal reviewer with my current repository permissions, so I am requesting your review here.

